<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116381" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡροσκοπ-εῖον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡρολόγιον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.5.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				2.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Boeth.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				11.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδριον ὡροσκοπεῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hero
					<u>Spir.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			<i>Praef.;</i>also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡροσκοπ-σκόπιον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				2.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.104
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑδρεῖα τῶν
			ὡροσκοπίων</span> water-<i>clocks,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				1335.14
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡροσκόπιον,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡροσκόπος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				5.68
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>instrument for observing the</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡροσκόπος, τῆς δι᾽ ἀστρολάβων
					ὡροσκοπίων κατ᾽ αὐτὴν τὴν ἔκτεξιν διοπτεύσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ptol.
					<u>Tetr.</u>
					108
				</span></i>
			.</div>
